<title>USA: ACCOUNT CLOSED - Minnesota $170 mln GO bonds.</title>
<headline>ACCOUNT CLOSED - Minnesota $170 mln GO bonds.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE OF MINNESOTA</p>
<p>RE: $170,000,000</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION STATE VARIOUS PURPOSE BONDS</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>THE 2002 MATURITY TRADED AT A 4.60 NET (DOWN 10)</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>Raymond, James &amp; Associates</p>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>IN ASSOCIATION WITH:</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
